\fs36 \cf2 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf2 \uc0\u1358 \u1377 \u1408 \u1386 \u1377 \u1408 \u1377 \u1398 
\f0 \cf2  (Varzharan)
\f2\b0 \cf2  is a managed online education company designed to connect 
\f0\b \cf2 Armenian-American students in the United States with highly vetted Armenian teachers and tutors in Armenia
\f2\b0 \cf2 .\
The goal is to build a 
\f0\b \cf2 real educational institution delivered online
\f2\b0 \cf2 , rather than another tutor marketplace or AI learning app.\

\f3 \cf2 \uc0\u1358 \u1377 \u1408 \u1386 \u1377 \u1408 \u1377 \u1398 
\f2 \cf2  should feel like a 
\f0\b \cf2 school
\f2\b0 \cf2 : structured, accountable, personal, academically rigorous, and trusted by parents.\
The core idea is simple:\

\f0\b \cf2 Exceptional Armenian educators. American academic standards. Personalized education.
\f2\b0 \cf2 \
The business is initially focused on 
\f0\b \cf2 K\'9612 mathematics
\f2\b0 \cf2 , with the possibility of expanding into other subjects later.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
