\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 The Problem\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf2 Parents often struggle to find tutors who combine:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Strong subject knowledge\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Excellent teaching ability\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Familiarity with the American curriculum\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reliability\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Accountability\
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Reasonable pricing\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Traditional tutoring marketplaces often create a poor experience:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	1	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Parent searches through hundreds of tutors.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	2	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Parent has to evaluate qualifications themselves.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	3	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Tutor may not understand the student's school curriculum.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	4	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
There is little accountability outside the lesson.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	5	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
There is no coherent long-term academic plan.\
\ls3\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	6	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
The parent receives little meaningful information about progress.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf2 \uc0\u1358 \u1377 \u1408 \u1386 \u1377 \u1408 \u1377 \u1398 
\f2 \cf2  solves this by 
\f0\b \cf2 managing the entire educational experience
\f2\b0 \cf2 .\
Parents should not feel that they are hiring a random tutor.\
They should feel that they are enrolling their child in a school.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
