\f0\b\fs48 \cf2 Core Product\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs24 \cf2 \uc0\u1358 \u1377 \u1408 \u1386 \u1377 \u1408 \u1377 \u1398 
\f2 \cf2  is a 
\f0\b \cf2 managed tutoring / online school platform
\f2\b0 \cf2 .\
A student does not simply book individual lessons.\
Instead, the student receives an educational program.\
Each student should have:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 1. Initial Assessment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf2 Before beginning instruction, the student completes an assessment designed to determine:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Current knowledge\
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Strengths\
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Weaknesses\
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Knowledge gaps\
\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
