\ls4\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Learning needs\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The assessment should produce a structured academic profile.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 2. Personalized Curriculum\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf2 Based on the assessment and the student's school curriculum, 
\f3 \cf2 \uc0\u1358 \u1377 \u1408 \u1386 \u1377 \u1408 \u1377 \u1398 
\f2 \cf2  creates a personalized learning plan.\
The curriculum should answer:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
What does the student already know?\
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
What do they need to learn?\
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
What should they learn next?\
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
How quickly should they progress?\
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Which concepts require reinforcement?\
\ls5\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
