\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The system should continuously adapt based on performance.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 3. Dedicated Teacher\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs24 \cf2 Students are matched with carefully selected Armenian teachers.\
Teachers should be 
\f0\b \cf2 vetted by 
\f1 \cf2 \uc0\u1358 \u1377 \u1408 \u1386 \u1377 \u1408 \u1377 \u1398 
\f2\b0 \cf2 , rather than simply creating profiles themselves.\
Potential vetting criteria include:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
